4138014282540294142_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bc4chQ8R_qYQ7kNvwEPT1S2&_nc_oc=Adpn2gzAwwYMSwBjxWmx_g-CeDsDwfQ65R_vXQwS_Sx4ynBOOtcxnW8XGnw8hT0Fffw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAlGR_9RQX0Yeoc1DN2--Tq0q1Zxhmgt8mVi2NFLnKPfw&oe=6A5CE383"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Air Distribution Systems", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Air Distribution Systems is an immersive VR training application developed by ImmerseLearn to enhance practical learning in HVAC air distribution. Designed as part of the Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program, this application enables learners to engage in realistic, scenario-based training that builds critical skills in system components, airflow management, and installation practices.\n\nThrough interactive simulations, users can explore key concepts, practice procedures, and gain confidence in a safe, controlled environment that mirrors real-world HVAC tasks. The experience is structured to reinforce theoretical knowledge through hands-on application, improving retention and job readiness.\n\nPlease note: This application is exclusively accessible to individuals enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program. Access is restricted and intended solely for registered learners as part of their training journey.", "short_description": "Air Distribution Systems is a VR training application from ImmerseLearn, designed to support hands-on skill development in HVAC air distribution concepts. This app is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the ImmerseLearn Air Distribution Systems micro-credential program and provides immersive, guided practice in real-world scenarios."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https: